# HubSpot

Call the HubSpot CRM as the connected user through the HubSpot MCP server
connected to this session. **You are already authenticated** — the session's
MCP relay attaches the user's HubSpot credential on every call, so never ask
for or handle credentials yourself.

{{ACTION_AVAILABILITY_SECTION}}

## Usage

Objects are `contacts`, `companies`, or `deals`. Read tools (list, get,
search, owners) run freely; creating and updating are the only writes. Read
tools that paginate should be capped with a result limit to keep your context
small.

