## Output

Tool results are JSON. List tools return the items and whether more existed
past the limit; failures return the HTTP status and message — surface the
error rather than retrying blindly.

## Notes

- Properties default to a useful subset per object; request others by their
  HubSpot internal property names (a comma-separated list, e.g.
  `dealname,amount`).
- Property keys are HubSpot internal property names (e.g. `email`,
  `firstname`, `dealname`, `amount`).
- If the server exposes a generic CRM-endpoint tool, pass user input as the
  JSON body, not by string-formatting into the path.
